ij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120876","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120876","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120876.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120876.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-03T15:02:40Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nRecently a new check was introduced when validating uniform sets in the rendering engine. This caused problems when stereo rendering because we were often checking against the wrong variant of the shader. Vulkan doesn't mind, the uniform set is created correctly and used in the correct situations, but our checks were run against the wrong setup.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes the immediate places where this is causing issues on a bare bones project. There may be additional places that needs similar fixes when certain functionality is enabled, but as there isn't a pattern to search on it's like finding a needle in a haystack.\r\n\r\n- Closes #120832\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis issue only effects the mobile and forward+ renderer.\r\nThe problem/fix can be tested without needing XR hardware by using [the mobile VR interface demo project](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/xr/mobile_vr_interface_demo) and switching the renderer to the appropriate one.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120876/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120876/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}